3) Asset sold at book value ₹50,000
   Bank A/c                  Dr.     50,000
      To Machinery A/c                       50,000

4) Asset sold at loss ₹5,000 (BV ₹50,000)
   Bank A/c                  Dr.     45,000
   Loss on Sale A/c          Dr.      5,000
      To Machinery A/c                       50,000

5) Asset sold at profit ₹8,000 (BV ₹50,000)
   Bank A/c                  Dr.     58,000
      To Machinery A/c                       50,000
      To Profit on Sale A/c                   8,000

6) Provision for doubtful debts created
   Profit & Loss A/c         Dr.     10,000
      To Provision for Doubtful Debts A/c    10,000

7) Bad debts written off against provision
   Provision for Doubtful Debts Dr.   5,000
      To Sundry Debtors A/c                   5,000

8) General reserve created
   Profit & Loss A/c         Dr.    50,000
      To General Reserve A/c                 50,000

